                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a1e5af6a-7900-4b84-a608-d0199790ed2d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableAppModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference in which application modes the schedule table should be started during startup</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableAppModeRef 配置项用于将操作系统的调度表与特定的应用模式关联起来，确保调度表仅在该应用模式下被启动。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的应用模式已在系统中定义；调度表与应用模式的关联必须符合系统的运行逻辑和需求；在多应用模式的系统中，正确管理不同调度表与应用模式的关联以避免潜在的冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00058</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsAppMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:c7cd0a08-1a1b-4d8f-aba8-a93a48a1a2a8">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableExpiryPoint</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The point on a Schedule Table at which the OS activates tasks and/or sets events</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableExpiryPoint 配置项用于定义操作系统调度表中的到期点，这些到期点指定了在特定时间点上应该执行的操作，如激活任务、设置事件。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsScheduleTableExpiryPoint时，需要确保到期点的时间偏移量是递增的，以保证调度表的正确执行；每个到期点上可以配置多个操作，但必须考虑系统的实时性和资源限制；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当遵循操作系统模块的时间属性和限制，以确保调度表的行为符合预期。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00143</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>true</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY-INFINITE>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ae9487c7-72d2-455b-84e3-0789069652ed">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTblExpPointOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The offset from zero (in ticks) at which the expiry point is to be processed.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTblExpPointOffset配置项用于定义操作系统调度表中的显式点（ExpPoint）相对于调度表开始的偏移时间，这有助于精确控制任务和事件的触发时机。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值必须小于调度表的周期，以确保显式点能够在每个调度周期内被准确触发；配置时需考虑系统的实时性要求，避免因偏移设置不当导致任务错过执行时机；在配置多个显式点时，需确保它们之间的偏移时间能够满足任务和事件的执行需求，避免冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:da6a454f-c51f-499f-bf85-327d654b710d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableEventSetting</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Event that is triggered by that schedule table.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableEventSetting用于配置操作系统调度表中的事件设置，它指定了调度表中的特定点应当触发的事件，以此来控制任务的执行和时间管理。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于OsScheduleTableEventSetting的具体属性和使用方式应当仔细参考OS模块的配置规范；确保每个调度点的事件设置不会导致任务的过度抢占或资源竞争；调度表的设计和事件设置应当满足实时性要求，避免系统的不确定性行为。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00059</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:5b6d6723-ab99-4855-b3a1-7307dcfb568c">
                              <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableSetEventRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to event that will be set by action</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableSetEventRef 配置项用于将操作系统调度表与特定事件关联起来，使得在调度表的特定点上可以设置（触发）这个事件。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的事件是有效的且与调度表兼容；调度表中设置事件的操作必须在定义的时间精度范围内；在多任务环境中，应注意事件触发与任务调度的同步问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00060</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsEvent</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:9c00d427-05c7-4bf2-960f-818e9c527827">
                              <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableSetEventTaskRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00061</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsTask</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f65324cd-90ca-4bd5-9ba2-7abc0b9a6489">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableTaskActivation</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Task that is triggered by that schedule table.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableSetEventTaskRef 配置项用于将操作系统调度表与任务相关联，并指定当调度表到达特定点时，应该设置的事件。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的任务和事件已经定义；调度表中的每个事件只能与一个任务相关联；在配置调度表时，应考虑系统的实时性和任务优先级。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00066</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <REFERENCES>
                            <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:a39530bb-23f0-4ff3-96c7-07c979bcfa55">
                              <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableActivateTaskRef</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">Reference to task that will be activated by action</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableTaskActivation 配置项用于定义操作系统调度表中的任务激活行为，它指定了在调度表的特定时间点应当激活哪些任务。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保任务的激活时间点不会导致任务间的资源冲突或违反实时性约束；调度表中的任务激活应与任务的周期性和实时性要求相匹配；在多核系统中，还需考虑任务在不同核心间的分配和同步问题。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00067</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsTask</DESTINATION-REF>
                            </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                          </REFERENCES>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                        <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:4517e21c-7943-450e-8038-ac3dc14794f6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTblAdjustableExpPoint</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Adjustable expiry point</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableActivateTaskRef 配置项用于指定操作系统调度表中激活任务的引用，它定义了调度表中的特定时间点上应当被激活的任务。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsScheduleTableActivateTaskRef时，需要关注任务的到期点偏移和到期点的执行动作。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00068</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <PARAMETERS>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:6dfec9f1-1edd-4155-9aee-bcc5a7eff09d">
                              <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableMaxLengthen</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The maximum positive adjustment that can be made to the expiry point offset (in ticks).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTblAdjustableExpPoint配置项用于定义可调度表中的可调整过期点，允许系统在运行时调整任务的执行时间点，以适应动态变化的调度需求。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项仅适用于支持可调度表的操作系统；必须确保系统时间同步机制的准确性，以避免调整过程中的时间误差；调整策略应考虑系统的实时性要求，避免因调整导致任务错过关键执行时刻。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00069</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                            <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:24814103-54dd-4a15-86ac-e315b1791fd0">
                              <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableMaxShorten</SHORT-NAME>
                              <DESC>
                                <L-2 L="EN">The maximum negative adjustment that can be made to the expiry point offset (in ticks).</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableMaxLengthen 配置项用于指定操作系统调度表的最大长度延长值，这是一个用于优化调度表时间精度的参数。</L-2>
                                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，调度表的长度通常是固定的，但是这个配置项允许系统设计者为调度表预留一些额外的时间，以便在必要时可以进行微调。需要确保这个延长值不会导致调度表超出系统的时间分辨率限制。此外，过大的MaxLengthen值可能会影响系统的实时性能，因此需要仔细评估和测试。</L-2>
                              </DESC>
                              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                              <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                              <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                                <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                                  <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                                </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                              <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                              <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                              <MIN>0</MIN>
                            </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                          </PARAMETERS>
                        </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                      </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6242bbd5-43d6-45a6-9128-fad562be2af9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTableSync</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container specifies the synchronization parameters of the schedule table.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableMaxShorten 配置项用于指定操作系统调度表（Schedule Table）可以被缩短的最大时间，这是为了提供调度表的灵活性，允许它在运行时适应系统的变化。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值必须小于或等于调度表周期的一半；过大的缩短值可能会导致调度表的不稳定或错过重要的执行点；在配置此参数时，应确保系统的实时性要求得到满足。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00063</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b2420449-8111-4d58-8338-b9068501a1a6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTblSyncStrategy</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">AUTOSAR OS provides support for synchronization in two ways: explicit and implicit.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTableSync配置项用于定义操作系统调度表的同步策略，确保调度表可以与外部时间源同步，以提高系统的时间精度和可靠性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：同步策略的选择应考虑系统的实时性要求和外部时间源的特性；不恰当的同步设置可能导致系统时间偏差增大，影响任务的准时执行；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准支持多种同步策略，包括无同步、隐式同步和显式同步，需根据具体应用场景选择合适的同步方式。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00065</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>NONE</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <LITERALS>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:27383f2c-9521-8b59-32c3-3dc3a4a89a97">
                              <SHORT-NAME>EXPLICIT</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:ab61576a-ae97-945c-2dfa-c1820014c8fa">
                              <SHORT-NAME>IMPLICIT</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                            <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:b7a6be99-cb10-878c-2453-88a1bf5922e1">
                              <SHORT-NAME>NONE</SHORT-NAME>
                              <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                            </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                          </LITERALS>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:123e7dad-40fd-4311-9cd7-bb56c0a5c4de">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsScheduleTblExplicitPrecision</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This configuration is only valid if the explicit synchronization is used.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsScheduleTblExplicitPrecision配置项用于定义操作系统调度表的显式精度，即系统可以接受的最大时间偏差，用于调整调度表的时间精度。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：精度值设置过大可能导致系统响应时间变慢，而设置过小可能导致系统无法满足时间精确性要求；该配置项对实时系统的时间管理至关重要，需根据实际应用场景谨慎设置；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项的值与系统的实际能力和需求相匹配。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00064</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:d693c889-237d-481d-836b-62c73ad00d48">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsSpinlock</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">An OsSpinlock object is used to co-ordinate concurrent access by TASKs/ISR2s on different cores to a shared resource.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSpinlock配置项用于定义操作系统层面的自旋锁，它允许在多核系统中同步对共享资源的访问，确保数据一致性和系统稳定性。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsSpinlock时，需要确保自旋锁的使用不会导致优先级反转问题；自旋锁应仅用于短时间的数据保护以避免长时间占用CPU资源；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对自旋锁的支持和配置要求可能与早期版本有所不同，需仔细参考最新标准文档。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">255</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00258</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a6a46311-b3c8-4178-acab-c75fa0d24275">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSpinlockLockMethod</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Lock method which is used when a spinlock is taken. Note that it is possible that a user (e.g. a Task) might hold more than one spinlock. In this case the last lock taken is forced to use at least a lock methode which locks as strong as the current one.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSpinlockLockMethod配置项定义了操作系统中自旋锁的锁定方法，这决定了在多核处理器环境中，如何实现对共享资源的互斥访问。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsSpinlockLockMethod时，需要确保所选的锁定方法与硬件架构和操作系统的能力相匹配；此外，应考虑锁定方法对系统性能的影响，因为不同的锁定方法可能会导致不同程度的CPU占用和延迟；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能对自旋锁的实现和配置提供了特定的指导，需要确保配置与标准的要求一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_01038</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>LOCK_NOTHING</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:31acd999-e8a4-8dc9-38f8-818cb1ea655a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LOCK_ALL_INTERRUPTS</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:08fd53b9-c8b5-8af6-2ea1-76a33ab1a912">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LOCK_CAT2_INTERRUPTS</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:ffe5b13f-d390-94ef-0a6e-bf3d7800f1b3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LOCK_NOTHING</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:976e7014-dde2-949b-28c9-041510e79421">
                          <SHORT-NAME>LOCK_WITH_RES_SCHEDULER</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cbdf0858-8e90-1cea-ede1-9827a6735184">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSpinlockLockType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Lock type which is used when a spinlock is taken. Note that it is possible that a user (e.g. a Task) might hold more than one spinlock. In this case the last lock taken is forced to use at least a lock methode which locks as strong as the current one.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSpinlockLockType配置项用于定义操作系统自旋锁的锁定机制，它指定了自旋锁在尝试获取锁时的行为方式，以确保在多核处理器环境中，对共享资源的访问是互斥的。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsSpinlockLockType时，需要确保所选的锁定机制与目标硬件平台和操作系统的能力相匹配；此外，应当考虑自旋锁的使用可能对系统性能产生的影响，特别是在高竞争环境下；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能定义了特定的锁类型和属性，因此需要确保配置与标准保持一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_01039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>STANDARD</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:21289b29-b304-cfe2-3d7b-e274529c9d4d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>STANDARD</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8b739d85-3086-8f0a-a311-6efa9b2fd696">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OPTIMIZED</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:804a40be-efb2-4923-b684-7466bf088f7e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSpinlockAccessingApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to OsApplications that have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSpinlockAccessingApplication 配置项用于指定哪些应用程序可以访问特定的自旋锁（Spinlock），确保操作系统管理的资源同步和互斥机制的正确性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保只有被授权的应用程序才能访问对应的自旋锁；不正确的配置可能导致系统安全性问题；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，自旋锁的访问控制应与应用程序的权限设置相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_01021</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:de2b3a13-fb51-4c88-980d-89bd9a102d2a">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsSpinlockSuccessor</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to OsApplications that have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsSpinlockSuccessor 配置项用于定义在释放自旋锁后，哪个任务或中断服务例程（ISR）将获得该自旋锁的控制权，这有助于管理操作系统的并发访问和锁的优先级继承。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsSpinlockSuccessor时，需要确保它与系统中的任务和ISR优先级设置相匹配，以避免优先级反转问题；此外，应当考虑自旋锁的使用对系统性能的影响，因为它们可能导致CPU占用和延迟增加；在多核系统中，还需注意自旋锁在不同核之间的行为和一致性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">To check whether a spinlock can be occupied (in a nested way) without any danger of deadlock, a linked list of spinlocks can be defined. A spinlock can only be occupied in the order of the linked list. It is allowed to skip a spinlock.

                                        If no linked list is specified, spinlocks cannot be nested.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_01022</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsSpinlock</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f9cd89d3-97e4-4f05-ad16-d8f577b726d0">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsTask</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container represents an ISO 17356 task.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTask配置项定义了操作系统任务的属性，包括任务的优先级、堆栈大小、调度策略等，是实现多任务调度的基础。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsTask时，必须确保任务的优先级设置合理，避免优先级反转问题；任务堆栈大小应足够大，以避免堆栈溢出；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，任务的调度策略应支持全抢占式和非抢占式两种模式。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <ADMIN-DATA>
                    <SDGS>
                      <SDG GID="VCOS:StringLength">
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MinLength">1</SD>
                        <SD GID="VCOS:MaxLength">63</SD>
                      </SDG>
                    </SDGS>
                  </ADMIN-DATA>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00073</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>65535</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f8b750d8-dc6e-418a-aa7b-c3c4bfe17b01">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskUsesFpu</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">true: open floating-point arithmetic.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskUsesFpu配置项用于指定操作系统任务是否使用浮点单元(FPU)，以确保任务在使用FPU时能够正确保存和恢复浮点寄存器的状态。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保仅对实际使用FPU的任务启用此选项，以避免不必要的性能开销；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准要求操作系统管理FPU上下文切换，因此正确配置此项对于系统稳定性和性能至关重要；在多任务环境中，未正确配置使用FPU的任务可能导致数据不一致和计算错误。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">false: close floating-point arithmetic..</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE"/>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f9b59379-7036-4b07-ab5c-2adfabf501c9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskSchedule</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The OsTaskSchedule attribute defines the preemptability of the task.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskSchedule配置项用于定义操作系统任务的调度策略，如全抢占式、非抢占式或混合调度策略，影响任务的运行和调度行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，任务调度策略的选择对系统响应时间和资源利用率有重要影响；选择非抢占式调度时，需特别注意任务执行时间，避免长时间占用CPU导致系统响应延迟；在配置OsTaskSchedule时，应确保与系统设计的实时性要求相匹配。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If this attribute is set to NON, no internal resources may be assigned to this task.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00076</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>FULL</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8b73a537-2bfc-90f9-634b-bd89f14f5d7f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>FULL</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:637b4dd5-ccdf-94c1-36a4-3733dddf49a3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>NON</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f9b59379-7036-4b07-ab5c-2adfabf501c9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskType</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The OsTaskType attribute defines the type of the task.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskType配置项用于定义操作系统任务的类型，它决定了任务的调度行为，如任务是基于时间的（周期性）还是事件驱动的（非周期性）。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，任务类型通常为BASIC或EXTENDED，其中BASIC类型的任务不支持事件机制，而EXTENDED类型的任务支持事件机制；选择任务类型时应考虑系统的实时性要求和复杂性；配置时需确保与操作系统的实现和系统设计文档保持一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00076</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>BASIC</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <LITERALS>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:8b73a537-2bfc-90f9-634b-bd89f14f5d7f">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EXTENDED</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF UUID="ECUC:637b4dd5-ccdf-94c1-36a4-3733dddf49a3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>BASIC</SHORT-NAME>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                        </ECUC-ENUMERATION-LITERAL-DEF>
                      </LITERALS>
                    </ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f53345d4-aac0-420f-ba25-d5b65b0dc33d">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskActivation</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This attribute defines the maximum number of queued activation requests for the task. A value equal to &quot;1&quot; means that at any time only a single activation is permitted for this task. Note that the value must be a natural number starting at 1.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskActivation 配置项用于定义操作系统任务的激活次数，即一个任务在操作系统启动后可以被激活的最大次数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，任务的激活次数必须是一个正整数，且应当根据系统需求和任务的设计来合理配置；超出配置的激活次数可能会导致系统拒绝额外的激活请求，从而影响系统行为；在多任务环境中，需要确保激活次数与任务的优先级和调度策略相匹配，以避免优先级反转或任务饥饿等问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00074</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>1</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX>255</MAX>
                      <MIN>1</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:61428e85-21e3-4df8-980f-9a985a02ede4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskPriority</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The priority of a task is defined by the value of this attribute. This value has to be understood as a relative value, i.e. the values show only the relative ordering of the tasks.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskPriority定义了操作系统任务的优先级，这是一个决定任务调度顺序的关键属性，高优先级的任务会先于低优先级的任务执行。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：优先级设置应避免优先级反转问题；在多任务系统中，合理分配优先级以确保实时性要求得到满足；AUTOSAR标准中，优先级的具体数值范围可能受到底层操作系统的限制。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">ISO 17356-3 defines the lowest priority as zero (0); larger values correspond to higher priorities.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <MAX>65534</MAX>
                      <MIN>0</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:61428e85-21e3-4df8-980f-9a985a02ede4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskStackSize</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The size of a task stack is defined by the value of this attribute.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskStackSize 配置项用于指定操作系统任务的堆栈大小，确保任务有足够的堆栈空间来执行其分配的函数和调用。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：堆栈大小必须足够以避免堆栈溢出，这可能导致系统不稳定；同时，过大的堆栈可能会浪费系统资源；在配置堆栈大小时，应考虑任务的复杂性和调用深度。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00075</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>1024</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <MAX>65535</MAX>
                      <MIN>128</MIN>
                    </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <REFERENCES>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:171cf36f-49fc-411f-a6a6-1d7b2ad3980c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskAccessingApplication</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Reference to applications which have an access to this object.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskAccessingApplication 配置项用于指定哪些AUTOSAR应用程序可以访问特定的操作系统任务，确保任务的访问控制符合系统安全要求。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保只有授权的应用程序能够访问对应的任务；此配置项与系统的安全等级和隔离机制密切相关；在多应用系统中，正确配置此项对于避免潜在的安全风险至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00077</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsApplication</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                    <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:7044fce9-f730-49ac-a996-dc177040d49e">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskEventRef</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This reference defines the list of events the extended task may react on.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskEventRef 配置项用于指定操作系统任务（OsTask）与事件（Event）之间的关联，这样当事件被触发时，相应的任务可以被激活或者通知。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsTaskEventRef时，需要确保引用的事件与任务是兼容的，并且在系统中是唯一的；此外，事件驱动的任务调度必须符合AUTOSAR OS的任务管理规范；在多任务环境中，还需注意任务优先级和事件处理的实时性要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00078</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>32</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsEvent</DESTINATION-REF>
                    </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                  </REFERENCES>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:e9cb3483-f89a-4318-bbc9-ad010cc385b3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskAutostart</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container determines whether the task is activated during the system start-up procedure or not for some specific application modes.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskAutostart配置项用于定义操作系统任务（OsTask）的自启动属性，指定系统启动时当前任务应该被自动启动。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置OsTaskAutostart时，需要确保任务的启动模式与系统设计和启动需求一致；对于不需要立即执行的任务，应避免配置为自启动，以减少系统启动时的负载；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，任务的自启动属性应与任务的优先级和调度策略相协调，确保系统的实时性和稳定性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">If the task shall be activated during the system start-up, this container is present and holds the references to the application modes in which the task is auto-started.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00080</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e7ace4a7-9613-4f24-908c-30ccc5bf56e6">
                          <SHORT-NAME>OsTaskAppModeRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to application modes in which that task is activated on startup of the OS</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsTaskAppModeRef 配置项用于指定操作系统任务（OsTask）在特定应用模式（AppMode）下的启动行为，确保任务只在其关联的应用模式下被激活。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保引用的应用模式已在系统中定义；每个任务可以关联多个应用模式，但应避免在不相关的模式下激活任务；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应用模式的引用应正确匹配OsAppMode类型的定义。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_Os_00081</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/Os/OsAppMode</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:f9cd89d3-97e4-4f05-ad16-d8f577b7dddd">
                  <SHORT-NAME>OsPublishedInformation</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">OsPublishedInformation is used for additional published parameters and information.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsPublishedInformation配置项定义了操作系统模块发布的信息，这些信息通常包括操作系统的供应商、版本号以及其他相关的标识信息。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保OsPublishedInformation中的信息准确反映了当前使用的操作系统的实际属性；此配置项通常由操作系统供应商预先定义，用户不需要修改；在整个项目或产品的生命周期中，应保持此信息的一致性，以便于软件的维护和兼容性检查。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>2</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f2fb51fb-7e81-486d-a6d4-c4eac7cec4c5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsKernelVersion</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines the kernel source code generation.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsKernelVersion 配置项用于指定操作系统内核的版本信息，确保系统组件与操作系统的兼容性。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保配置的内核版本与实际使用的AUTOSAR OS模块版本一致；不正确的版本信息可能导致系统行为不符合预期；在进行系统集成时，应仔细核对所有组件的版本信息以避免兼容性问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>false</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f2fb51fb-7e81-486d-a6d4-c4eac7cec4c5">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsPlatformName</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Defines the name of the platform supported with this BSWMD.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：OsPlatformName 配置项用于指定操作系统平台的名称，这通常是为了与特定的硬件架构或操作系统实现相关联。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，操作系统的名称应与实际使用的操作系统平台保持一致；如果使用标准的AUTOSAR OS，应选择相应的标准名称；在配置时需确保名称的唯一性和正确性，以避免与其他软件组件的兼容性问题。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <REQUIRES-INDEX>false</REQUIRES-INDEX>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        <ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>Platform</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX-LENGTH>63</MAX-LENGTH>
                          <MIN-LENGTH>1</MIN-LENGTH>
                        </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-CONDITIONAL>
                      </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF-VARIANTS>
                    </ECUC-STRING-PARAM-DEF>
                  </PARAMETERS>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:74cbb4f9-b60a-40f2-97ea-f951f5411d3c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>OsDerivativeInformation</SHORT-NAME>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
